# Try It deployment runtime cache. The PyTorch checkpoint downloaded from
# Genentech/assayformer and temporary ONNX exports stay here. The verified,
# public s19 browser graph is intentionally published under docs/assets/model/.
# Authentication tokens are never checked into this repository.
deployment/.model-cache/


